# Forever Feral Druid (cat), aligned with wowsims/forever's Monocat APL (reference only): Shred on Clearcasting (Claw
# out of position), Shifting Power below 40 energy under Clearcasting and 50 without, Berserk ahead of a due Rake, Rip
# at the set combo points and Rake as they fall off, never clipping, the rest into Shred (Claw when the target faces
# you), holding the energy the refreshes need (excess_e), and Innervate in Cat when mana runs short.

actions.precombat=mark_of_the_wild,if=settings.buffs&!buff.mark_of_the_wild.up&!buff.gift_of_the_wild.up
actions.precombat+=/thorns,if=settings.buffs&!buff.thorns.up
actions.precombat+=/cat_form,if=!buff.cat_form.up
actions=cat_form,if=!buff.cat_form.up
actions+=/shifting_power,if=energy.current<40|!buff.clearcasting.up&energy.current<50
actions+=/use_items
actions+=/berserk,use_off_gcd=1,if=!debuff.rake.up&!(combo_points.current>=settings.rip_cp&!debuff.rip.up)
actions+=/shred,focus=1,if=buff.clearcasting.up&shred_ok
actions+=/claw,focus=1,if=buff.clearcasting.up&!shred_ok
actions+=/rip,focus=1,if=combo_points.current>=settings.rip_cp&!debuff.rip.up
actions+=/rake,focus=2,if=!debuff.rake.up
actions+=/ferocious_bite,if=settings.bite_finisher&combo_points.current>=5&debuff.rip.up&excess_e>=energy.current
actions+=/shred,if=shred_ok&excess_e>=action.shred.cost
actions+=/claw,if=!shred_ok&excess_e>=action.claw.cost
actions+=/innervate,focus=2,if=settings.innervate&buff.cat_form.up&mana.pct<settings.feral_innervate_mana&energy.current<=30&!buff.clearcasting.up&!buff.berserk.up
